  "body": "\n\n## Changed\n\n- Update all themes by @missionis in #727, #735, #739, #746, #754, #769\n\n## Documentation\n\n- Correct schema URL replacement conditions in build script by @pamburus in #777\n\n## Other\n\n- Bump rust toolchain and MSRV to 1.95 by @pamburus in #763\n- Eliminate warnings in release builds by @pamburus in #772\n- Disable Rust cache in release builds by @pamburus in #773\n- Check release cross targets build without warnings by @pamburus in #774\n- Pin GitHub runner images by @pamburus in #775\n- Lower glibc requirement of x86_64 Linux GNU binary by @pamburus in #776\n- Clean up leftovers of previous runs in the release workflow by @pamburus in #786\n\n## Dependencies\n\n- Bump DavidAnson/markdownlint-cli2-action by @dependabot in #712\n- Bump DeterminateSystems/nix-installer-action from 22 to 23 by @dependabot in #723\n- Bump actions-rust-lang/setup-rust-toolchain by @dependabot in #726\n- Bump actions/create-github-app-token from 3.2.0 to 3.3.0 by @dependabot in #761\n- Bump base64 from 0.22.1 to 0.23.1 by @dependabot in #706\n- Bump cachix/cachix-action by @dependabot in #718\n- Bump cachix/install-nix-action from 31.10.6 to 31.11.1 by @dependabot in #711\n- Bump codecov/codecov-action from 7.0.0 to 7.1.1 by @dependabot in #731\n- Bump dirs from 6.0.0 to 7.0.0 by @dependabot in #721\n- Bump dtolnay/rust-toolchain by @dependabot in #734, #751, #762\n- Bump lumis from 0.11.0 to 0.17.1 by @dependabot in #705, #757\n- Bump taiki-e/install-action from 2.82.6 to 2.87.29 by @dependabot in #713, #717, #725, #733, #738, #752, #759\n- Bump the codeql-action-ver group across 1 directory with 2 updates by @dependabot in #730, #750, #758\n- Bump the codeql-action-ver group with 2 updates by @dependabot in #709, #722\n- Bump tombi-toml/setup-tombi from 1.2.0 to 1.8.5 by @dependabot in #710, #716, #724, #732, #753, #760\n- Switch from Dependabot to Renovate and pin CI tools by @pamburus in #764\n- Update cachix/install-nix-action action to v31.11.3 by @renovate in #779\n- Update csscolorparser to 0.9 by @renovate in #783\n- Update dependencies by @missionis in #708, #715, #720, #729, #737, #741, #748, #756, #771\n- Update dependency ubuntu to v26 by @renovate in #785\n- Update github/codeql-action action to v4.39.1 by @renovate in #780\n- Update nix flake dependencies by @missionis in #707, #714, #719, #728, #736, #740, #747, #755, #770\n- Update nixos/nix docker tag to v2.35.3 by @renovate in #765\n- Update nixos/nix docker tag to v2.35.4 by @renovate in #768\n- Update rust to 1.99 by @renovate in #766\n- Update swatinem/rust-cache action to v2.9.3 by @renovate in #781\n- Update taiki-e/install-action action to v2.87.31 by @renovate in #782\n- Update tombi-toml/setup-tombi action to v1.9.3 by @renovate in #784\n- Widen Renovate schedules and use `build` commit type by @pamburus in #778\n\n## New Contributors\n\n* @renovate made their first contribution in #783\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/pamburus/termframe/compare/v0.8.8...v0.9.0\n",
